    "description": "One of the oldest known members of the human lineage, from the Late Miocene of Chad, about 7 million years ago. It was a chimpanzee-sized ape with a small brain, a huge brow ridge, a rather flat face and small canine teeth. The way its skull sat on the spine suggests it could walk upright, though it still lived among trees by lakes and forest edges."
